## Slide 1: Title Slide
* **Title:** DairyGuard: Milk Collection Center Quality Control and Cold-Chain Spoilage Prevention System
* **Subtitle:** INSY 8311 – Database Development with PL/SQL (Capstone Project – Phase 0)
